   SubscriptBox["R", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "479c55c1-a646-004a-9f0e-a77b9739872c"],
 " and the last two ones are acceptable. However, it will be shown that to \
the positive root a very long tube is associated. In fact, the coma vanishes \
when"
}], "Text",
